}=-{b}_{2}$, ${c}_{2}=2{b}_{3}$ and ${c}_{3}={b}_{1}?$" :question/worked-solution "Since $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$, we can write $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={b}_{1}-3{b}_{2}+6{b}_{3} \\\\  & =-3{b}_{2}+6{b}_{3}+{b}_{1} \\\\  & =3(-{b}_{2})+3(2{b}_{3})+{b}_{1} \\\\  & =3{c}_{1}+3{c}_{2}+{c}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-80814/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "df96d21a-e1bc-5a9b-b528-d6e7b30d8451"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-80814"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-112810/selection/e5a6d3820f404eb9a25506bc0b442e187fae7e1158e715c08529faafd860eb9d" :answer/id #uuid "d762b46a-0598-54a4-a12e-fc5a54a9b6eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112810/selection/86693511dddecda38d4eed61be27e6fdd97e4eb0b5e1db73e25a78450fd4eed9" :answer/id #uuid "c851f7c7-8977-5d58-b43c-28d22ade8fdd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112810/selection/053d5e920463e92bc50dccabc7ea05c213457a2012c89cb173b71d4548895e8e" :answer/id #uuid "fff5c31a-15cb-5e6e-bbfa-d344737e1cbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112810/selection/9faab7db0db27601ab7c5409455f297bf8c3563f5892b6ac520f7f6384c5a85d" :answer/id #uuid "f1456cc1-3d15-5285-b76a-355285046b1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-112810/selection/6bce8fe78362c4eca82f769c34d4f401fb853019ca7720190210ef0e0bd0ef35" :answer/id #uuid "397f0c6d-24ce-5c14-b9ca-b101